            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Probably a third-party issue. If `cynetworkx` does not declare Cython as a build dependency, then pip won't install it for the build. pip uses separate environments for builds these days to make sure you get a clean build, regardless of your local Python installation's mess.",
